{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27632","headline":"投常州从兄中丞 · 张祜","name":"投常州从兄中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟何所往，言入善人邦。\n旧爱鹏抟海，今闻虎渡江。\n士因爲政乐，儒爲说诗降。\n素履冰容静，新词玉润枞。\n金鱼聊解带，画鷁稍移桩。\n邀妓思逃席，留宾命倒缸。\n史材谁是伍，经术世无双。\n广厦当宏构，洪钟并待撞。\n成龙须讲邴，展骥莫先庞。\n应念宗中末，秋萤照一牕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}